
CORE CONCEPTS

  resource      Single canonical item (skill, rule, MCP, hook, agent, ...)
  plugin        Named bundle of resources you apply to projects
  profile       Plugin tagged profile; apply globally with profile use
  account       HarnessTap Cloud login identity stored locally
  environment   Named how-values (vars, secrets, model config)
  harness       Target CLI (claude-code, codex, cursor, ...)

HARNESS ROLES

  registered    Harnesses HarnessTap writes to (harness set --harnesses)
  default       First registered harness: mirror source and scans when none is named

COMMON COMMANDS

  ht plugin apply <plugin>  Materialize plugins onto a project
  ht profile use <profile>  Apply a profile plugin globally to home harness files
  ht migrate export <archive>  Share your full local workspace with another machine
  ht mirror .  Sync registered harnesses from the first registered one on disk
  ht plugin list --search foundation --remote-only  Browse public catalog plugins
  ht plugin pull org/catalog/engineering-foundation  Cache a catalog plugin locally
  ht plugin edit <plugin> --add <item> --type skill  Add a local resource to a plugin

ENVIRONMENT CASCADE

  home env ◂ plugin default env (last wins on apply)

SCENARIOS

   1  Bootstrap HarnessTap on a machine and discover existing defaults
   2  Choose your registered harnesses
   3  Override harness preferences for one repository  Common · Shipped
   4  Scan an existing repository and import its current harness setup  Common · Shipped
   5  Build a reusable plugin from imported resources  Occasional · Shipped
